I usually try to suggest things based on two factors:<BR>1) Exp<BR>2) Loot<P>If we are just after exp...it better be damn good exp.<P>If we are after just loot, it better be real nice loot.<P>So...I try to suggest places that have a nice balance between the two and so far, the places that have had that balance...have been the places we have had the most fun in.  Like Nurga/Droga & Keasora.  Keasora was flipping awesome...wish we had stayed there longer to tell ya all the truth.  <P>Another "fun factor" seems to be places that we can "crawl" thru the dungeon instead of camp a spawn.  I know Brod has fun, but he get's to pull, so he sees more of the dungeon, but for the rest of us. It's get to the room and sit.  Stand up, /assist, attack then sit again.  We never really get to see the dungeon past the room.<P>The Hole...might be do-able, but we could only take the entrance Elementals. There are 6-10 elementals that spawn in the entry hallway.  Past that and we would die to the 49-52th level spawning Golem. Loot there is pretty good though and zone exp modifier is also damn nice.  Entrance could be camped, but since Toxx portal is close to Painell, it's easy to check though.<P>LGuk...crap shoot there.  It all depends on what is camped.  More likely to get good to excellent loot at the expense of poor/slow exp or poor loot and great exp...just depends on what is camped and where you go.<P>SolB...See LGuk.<P>Tower of Frozen Shadow, we could re-visit that place.  There is a nice helm that drops on the 5th floor...better then the Lambent for a bard even.  The bottleneck there is the 4th floor key and if camped...then we can't move past that spot.  There are also a few more people that could probably use that range slot caster stuff from the 2nd floor.<P>Wakening Lands, we could camp the Raptors and Flying Monkies to do the Ice Shackle Bracer quest for Erlas and Brinne.  There are a few others in the guild that could use one of those bracers too...we could turn it into a mini-guild "raid".  Exp would be pretty good too.  <P>Kael...we could do the entrance giants, but loot is pretty darn poor there.  Exp would be so-so, but we would be gaining dorf and CoV faction.<P>SkyShrine...loot & exp would be good, at the cost of losing CoV faction...and lots of it too.<P>Cobalt Scar...loot would stink except for the armor quest gems & exp would be good.  High risk due to Cobalt Drakes.  Getting the CS Port tooth for everyone would be nice though.<P>--------------------<P>Verser - Bard of the 51st Song
